Ray: tab-modal dialogs still open when their tab closes go in WebContentsDestroyed, while the tab is whole,
not from the host's destructor at the end of ~WebContentsImpl, where the sign-in dialog's CancelAuth read the
tab's destroyed NavigationController (crash on chrome.tabs.remove of a tab showing it; docs/MISSING.md #68).

